In Japan your bill won't come until you ask 🧾
Say it, then pay at the register on your way out.

Today's phrases:
• おかいけいを おねがいします (okaikei o onegaishimasu) = The check, please
• しょうしょう おまちください (shoushou omachi kudasai) = One moment, please
• すみません (sumimasen) = Excuse me

